  "description": "The Flightline 26\" Plus has a personality all its own thanks to its unique 26\" WTB Plus tires and a massive 2.8\" footprint mounted to alloy double wall rims, alloy hubs, and stainless steel spokes. It is sized as a 26\", but it rides and fits like a 27.5\" as its tire diameter is bigger than on a conventional 26\" model. FL 26\" Plus features a 6000 series alloy frame with IS disc mounts, internal cable routing, internal head tube, all matched to a Suntour XCT suspension fork with 100mm of travel. Between the suspension fork and the fat tires, you might not even notice the bumps were there. A 24-speed drive train makes the FL 26 Plus an ideal adventurer and bike packing companion. Explore!\nMY19 Haro FL 26\" Plus, 6000 series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nMY19 Suntour XCT HLO 27.5\" fork w/ 100mm travel, hydraulic lockout\nSuntour XCC 42/34/24 alloy crankset, 50mm chainline\nShimano Altus M310, 8-spd rear derailleur\nShimano HG-200 8-spd 12-32t cassette\nXD-155 alloy DW rims, 32mm wide\nPivit alloy cassette 32h hubs, Boost rear\nWTB Ranger 26x2.8\" tires\nPromax DSK-300 brakeset w/ 160mm rotors",
